{
  "id": "ch01_s04_shuge",
  "chapter": 1,
  "act": 1,
  "scene": "shuge",
  "palette": "ink",
  "cast": [
    "wuze",
    "shenheng"
  ],
  "weightless": false,
  "leavesLetter": [
    "shenheng"
  ],
  "purpose": "两人对沉默如何入卷互不让步，却愿意继续相处",
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "ch01_s04_shuge.l1",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "当夜，你放下茶碗，去书阁找沈衡。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s04_shuge.l2",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "书阁灯火罩在卷架外，整排架脚没入暗处；沈衡将两卷纸隔开一掌。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s04_shuge.l3",
      "who": "shenheng",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "这边。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s04_shuge.l4",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "这里？"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s04_shuge.l5",
      "who": "shenheng",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "坐这边，灯不会被你挡住。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s04_shuge.l6",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "沈衡，你待纸倒周到。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s04_shuge.l7",
      "who": "shenheng",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "人会自己找亮处。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s04_shuge.l8",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "也是。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s04_shuge.l9",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "你坐下。她还是把灯往你这边挪了些。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s04_shuge.l10",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "这句“无异辞”，是人人都答了？"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s04_shuge.l11",
      "who": "shenheng",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "这句？"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s04_shuge.l12",
      "who": "shenheng",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "卷上只留了这三个字。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s04_shuge.l13",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "这三个字……"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s04_shuge.l14",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "没答，也能算进去？"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s04_shuge.l15",
      "who": "shenheng",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "能，可我不能添一句“她不肯”。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s04_shuge.l16",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "那它倒替她肯了。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s04_shuge.l17",
      "who": "shenheng",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s04_shuge.l18",
      "who": "shenheng",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "所以得找原问辞，再找当日的人。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s04_shuge.l19",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "可等到找到——"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s04_shuge.l20",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "沈衡伸手去压卷角，压偏了半寸。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s04_shuge.l21",
      "who": "shenheng",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "我找过。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s04_shuge.l22",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s04_shuge.l23",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "她收回手，麻纸的毛边刮过指腹；纸角又翘了起来。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s04_shuge.l24",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "她还在么？"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s04_shuge.l25",
      "who": "shenheng",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "不在这里了。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s04_shuge.l26",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s04_shuge.l27",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "我没让你编，只怕等得太久。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s04_shuge.l28",
      "who": "shenheng",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "我怕写得太快，她还没来得及张口，我们就收卷了。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s04_shuge.l29",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "太快。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s04_shuge.l30",
      "who": "shenheng",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "卷里已经有了替她说的话。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s04_shuge.l31",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "灯芯响了一声。谁都没有让步。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s04_shuge.l32",
      "who": "shenheng",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "换半句。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s04_shuge.l33",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "半句？"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s04_shuge.l34",
      "who": "shenheng",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "这个我知道怎么判。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s04_shuge.l35",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "也先说规矩。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s04_shuge.l36",
      "who": "shenheng",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "听着。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s04_shuge.l37",
      "who": "shenheng",
      "expr": "open",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "五个字，物、处所、动作，末字平声。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s04_shuge.l38",
      "who": "shenheng",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "poem",
      "text": "明月松间照。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s04_shuge.l39",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "open",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "接错了呢？"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s04_shuge.l40",
      "who": "shenheng",
      "expr": "open",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "接错了也可以再坐一会儿，我这盏灯又不急着熄。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s04_shuge.l41",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "open",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s04_shuge.l42",
      "who": "shenheng",
      "expr": "open",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "我也没说，只为听你的对句。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s04_shuge.l43",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "你看向门，门一直开着，外头的冷气贴着席边流进来。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s04_shuge.l44",
      "who": "self",
      "kind": "inner",
      "text": "（留下，便不是因为走不了。）"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s04_shuge.l45",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "你在书阁的灯边坐定，等她听你的对句。"
    }
  ],
  "duel": "pd_01"
}
